    "scientific_interpretation": "Relation factorization plus distribution matching preserved low unseen NLL and support diffusion improved its own raw recall, but generic category/kind relations replaced task-specific label geometry. With zero exact entity support in task-disjoint training folds, the model propagated probability to semantically related but causally wrong effects, causing low precision, excess false positives, seed instability, and rollout degradation. Architecture-only open-vocabulary search on the 121-row dataset is closed; the next authorized research direction is explicit label-disjoint branching support collection."
